    "source": "https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/45976728 (centroid of the walled town, i.e. of the inner face of the wall closed across the cimorro; heading = the east front, Puerta del Alcázar – cimorro – Puerta de San Vicente, facing the plain to the east)"
  },
  "authors": [
    {
      "name": "Álvaro C. Chulvi",
